<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>HoloDream 自製組隊工具（修復版）</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#1e1e24;--panel:#2a2a35;--main:#25252f;--blue:#00a2ff;--green:#2ed573;--orange:#ffa500}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:"PingFang TC","Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif;margin:0;padding:16px;background:var(--bg);color:#fff;min-height:100vh;display:flex;gap:16px}
#sidebar{width:300px;flex:0 0 300px;background:var(--panel);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px #0004;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;max-height:calc(100vh - 32px);overflow-y:auto}
#main-panel{flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--main);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 15px #0004;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:calc(100vh - 32px)}
h2,h3{margin:0;padding-bottom:5px;color:var(--blue)}h2{font-size:20px}h3{border-bottom:1px solid #444;font-size:14px;margin-top:5px}
.filter-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.btn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:6px}
.filter-btn{background:#3a3a4c;color:#fff;border:1px solid #555;padding:8px 6px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;font-size:12px;transition:.15s}
.filter-btn:hover{background:#4a4a60}.filter-btn.active{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);font-weight:bold}
.reset-btn{background:#ff4d4d;color:white;border:0;padding:10px;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold}.reset-btn:hover{background:#ff3333}
#hint-text{color:#ccc;font-size:12px;background:#1a1a22;padding:9px;border-radius:6px;border-left:4px solid #ff4d4d;line-height:1.5}
.toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;color:#aaa;font-size:12px}.toolbar input{background:#191920;border:1px solid #555;color:white;padding:8px;border-radius:6px;min-width:190px}
.grid-container{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;margin-top:15px;padding:2px 5px 8px 2px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:12px}
.card{background:#323242;border:2px solid #444;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer;transition:all .18s ease;position:relative;min-width:0}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:#777}.card .name{font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:7px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.card .tag-container{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px}.tag{font-size:10px;background:#ffffff1a;padding:3px 5px;border-radius:4px}
.skill-info{font-size:12px;color:#ddd;background:#0003;padding:7px;border-radius:5px;text-align:left;line-height:1.5;min-height:36px}
.card.match-filter{border-color:var(--blue);background:#1a2f4c}.card.synergy-partner{border-color:var(--green);background:#143525;box-shadow:0 0 8px #2ed57355}.card.selected-core{border-color:var(--orange);background:#4c3a1a;box-shadow:0 0 10px #ffa50066}.card.dimmed{opacity:.25}
.legend{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#bbb;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}
#empty-state{display:none;color:#aaa;padding:30px;text-align:center}
@media(max-width:760px){body{flex-direction:column;padding:10px}#sidebar{width:100%;flex-basis:auto;max-height:none}#main-panel{min-height:60vh;padding:14px}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(165px,1fr))}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<aside id="sidebar">
<h2>組隊篩選面板</h2>
<div id="hint-text">💡 點擊任一角色卡片，查看依照其被動技能條件可共鳴的隊友。再次點擊同一張卡片即可取消選取。</div>
<button class="reset-btn" id="resetBtn">清除所有條件 / 取消選取</button>
<div class="filter-group"><h3>服裝系列</h3><div class="btn-grid">
<button class="filter-btn" data-type="app" data-value="普通">📊 普通類別</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="app" data-value="泳裝">👙 泳裝類別</button>
</div></div>
<div class="filter-group"><h3>類型（屬性）</h3><div class="btn-grid">
<button class="filter-btn" data-type="attr" data-value="可愛">❤️ 可愛</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="attr" data-value="清純">🤍 清純</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="attr" data-value="快樂">💛 快樂</button>
</div></div>
<div class="filter-group"><h3>專長</h3><div class="btn-grid">
<button class="filter-btn" data-type="spec" data-value="表現力">🔺 表現力</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="spec" data-value="技巧">🟩 技巧</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="spec" data-value="品味">🔷 品味</button>
</div></div>
<div class="filter-group"><h3>被動技能效果</h3><div class="filter-group">
<button class="filter-btn" data-type="skill" data-value="表現力UP">🔺 表現力 UP</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="skill" data-value="技巧UP">🟩 技巧 UP</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="skill" data-value="品味UP">🔷 品味 UP</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="skill" data-value="能力UP">⭐ 自身／對象全能力 UP</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="skill" data-value="分數支援">💰 分數支援</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="skill" data-value="無">⚪ 無技能資料</button>
</div></div>
<div class="filter-group"><h3>團隊 / 期別</h3><div class="btn-grid">
<button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="JP 0期生">JP 0期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="JP 1期生">JP 1期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="GAMERS">GAMERS</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="JP 2期生">JP 2期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="JP 3期生">JP 3期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="JP 4期生">JP 4期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="JP 5期生">JP 5期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="holoX">holoX（6期）</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="ID 1期生">ID 1期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="ID 2期生">ID 2期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="ID 3期生">ID 3期生</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="Myth">Myth（EN1）</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="Promise">Promise</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="Advent">Advent</button><button class="filter-btn" data-type="gen" data-value="ReGLOSS">ReGLOSS（DEV_IS）</button>
</div></div>
</aside>
<main id="main-panel">
<h2 id="panel-title">HoloDream 成員配對庫</h2>
<div class="toolbar"><input id="searchBox" type="search" placeholder="搜尋角色名稱或技能…" aria-label="搜尋角色名稱或技能"><span id="count"></span></div>
<div class="legend"><span><i class="dot" style="background:#00a2ff"></i>符合篩選</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#2ed573"></i>技能共鳴夥伴</span><span><i class="dot" style="background:#ffa500"></i>目前選取角色</span></div>
<div class="grid-container"><div class="grid" id="cardGrid"></div><div id="empty-state">沒有符合條件的角色，請調整篩選條件。</div></div>
</main>
